PRESSURE NOW

Preserve exact A52
current committed pressure.

For committed side s:

compute:

B_pre;

current local evidence;

current signed B update;

A45 one-epoch cooperative echo;

current mode;

Q_raw;

Q_echo;

Q_eff;

PRESSURE_now.

