VETO MUST BE ACTIVE

A53_VETO_MECHANISM_ACTIVE
within a D/P family iff:

1. TAU3_VETO uses
   delayed pressure
   in at least 25%
   of committed decisions
   where fixed TAU3 history
   is available;

and

2. veto fires
   in at least 25%
   of fixed-TAU3
   pre-reversal-pressure decisions
   at true-reversal epoch 2;

and

3. all vetoed decisions
   use current pressure exactly.

These are mechanism checks,
not scientific success thresholds.

